Membership inference Adversary determines if a record was in training set Differential privacy; regularization
Gradient leakage Adversary infers data from gradients Secure aggregation; gradient compression
Poisoning Malicious party corrupts model Robust aggregation (Krum, Trimmed Mean)
Collusion Multiple parties collude to infer data Threshold cryptography; minimum party requirements

